{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50867","headline":"省题诗二十一首 未明求衣 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 未明求衣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夙夜甯无准，忧勤事万机。\n良宵犹未曙，深殿早求衣。\n长乐钟才动，华胥梦已归。\n丝纶传紫禁，黼黻进彤闱。\n被处烛仍在，垂时星始稀。\n岂（一作「恭」）惟汉文帝，因此致巍巍。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}